@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health check
GET {{host}}/

### 2. List assignments
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Create a valid submission (201 Created)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/SV001/signalr"
}

### 4. Get the created submission (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Create a submission with missing data (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": " "
}

### 6. Submit to a missing assignment (404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/SV001/signalr"
}

### 7. Get a missing submission (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. SignalR negotiate at the correct hub path (200 OK)
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. SignalR negotiate at the incorrect hub path (404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
